    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "STANFORD\nWelcome Aboard!",
      "Pan American is pleased to serve you on your trip\nto the Stanford Campus at Stuttgart and we hope\nthat you are enjoying every moment of your\nClipper flight. Once again — Welcome Aboard!\nPAN AMERICAN",
      "MONR\nSAN FRANCISCO - STUTTGART\nLuncheon\nRelishes\nChicken Consomme\nMonte Cristo Sandwich\nCottage Cheese and Pear Salad\nClipper Ice Cream\nFruit Basket\nCoffee\nTea\nMilk\nDinner\nVegetable Juice\nCheese Wafers\nSalted Nuts\nOlives\nWhite Wine, Pouilly Fuisse\nShrimp Cocktail\nStuffed Idlewild Farm Rock Cornish Game Hen\nChampagne Sauce\nButtered Peas and Carrots\nParisienne Potatoes\nSalad in Season\nFrench Pastries\nCoffee\nTea\nFruit Basket\nMilk\nJelly\nCoffee\nBreakfast\nChilled Orange Juice\nBreakfast Fruit\nMushroom Omelet\nPork Link Sausage\nPetit Danish\nButter\nJam\nTea\nToast\nHoney\nMilk\nChampagne Service\nChampagne, Charles Heidsieck\nAmerican College Sandwich\nStanford Cake\nCoffee\nTea\nMilk"
    ],
